  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IWPR Media Training Kosov</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IWPR mediautbildning Kvo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IWPR skall genomf&#xf6;ra journalistutbildning f&#xf6;r lokala journalister fr&#xe5;n Kosovo. DE skall arbeta med unga, aktiva journalister och deras arbete kommer att publiceras i s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l lokala medier som i medier runtom Europa. Tonvikten ligger p&#xe5; rapportering om MR-fr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IWPR will conduct training in journalism to local journalists from Kosovo. They will work with young, active journalists and their work will be used in local media as well as syndicated throughout Europe. The emphasis is on human rights issues.</narrative>
  </description>
